Research probe for issues #56/#58, already served its purpose (informed the real
check_sat() fix in commit 02e500d) -- not kept as an ongoing regression gate since no
committed golden exists to compare against (it would trivially "pass" forever
regardless of what Simplify actually says). Run manually for an up-to-date assessment
if Simplify's error vocabulary is ever in question again:
bash runscript scripts/solverBehavior/simplify-error-probe.scr
